# Client-side build values for production bundles. Safe to commit — all three
# are public by design and ship inside the JS bundle regardless: the anon key
# is Supabase's public client key (guarded by RLS), the Mapbox token is a
# public pk.* token. Real secrets (db url, service role, Gemini) stay in
# runtime env vars and are never in the repo.
#
# Vite reads this automatically for `vite build` via envDir '..'.
